linhas.en:
#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.
You've accumulated a lot of fatigue;
any more will be dangerous!

I'm a puppet of high worth, so to speak.
You, however, are in reality worth nothing;
a pebble with a price tag of zero.

Yeah. She, for sure,
is the embodiment of allure;
she could lead #[any man][anyone, man or not,]# astray.

One of #C236196003Hans Christian Andersen#CDEF's masterpieces;
it's a fairy tale about a sea of liars
and one single, honest person.
